these terms. Third-party materials are excluded as described in Section 6.

"Teradata Products" means software products, platforms, or services supplied
and licensed or otherwise lawfully made available by Teradata, including
Teradata database, analytics, and vector-store products and services.

"Permitted Purpose" means developing, testing, integrating, deploying,
operating, or maintaining solutions based on or used with Teradata Products.
Such solutions must actually use, integrate with, or be developed for Teradata
Products. Merely referring to Teradata, retaining a Teradata logo, or including
